    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="14">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Ine">Ine</ref> 14</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">{LVIII} Se ðe hloþe betygen sie, geswicne se hine be CXX hida oððe swa bete.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">He who is accused of taking part in a raid by a band [of thieves], let him clear himself by [an oath of] 120 hides or pay equivalent compensation.</ab>
        <ab type="secondTranslation" xml:lang="en">He who is accused of belonging to a band of marauders shall clear himself [of such a charge] with an oath of 120 hides, or pay corresponding compensation.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Se ðe hloðe betogen sy, geswicne se hine be CXX hida oððe bete swa.</ab>
      </div>
